{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794570711211,"sessionID":"ses_e2b4abdd3ffe0ORlG2coZj9Q9y","part":{"partID":"prt_1d4bfeaef002Zjkc8427lDR335","sessionID":"ses_e2b4abdd3ffe0ORlG2coZj9Q9y","messageID":"msg_1d4bfe14c001glMLLnwMyFPjR0","type":"tool","id":"call_d4db1c298d6241599ac60ac3","tool":"shell","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"L=specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/lineages/inprocess-timing-4\njq -c 'select(.type==\"iteration\") | {iteration,status,newInfoRatio,findingsCount}' \"$L/deep-research-state.jsonl\"; echo \"=== questions ===\"; sed -n '/ANCHOR:key-questions/,/\\/ANCHOR:key-questions/p' \"$L/deep-research-strategy.md\"; echo \"=== answered ===\"; sed -n '/ANCHOR:answered-questions/,/\\/ANCHOR:answered-questions/p' \"$L/deep-research-strategy.md\"; echo \"=== next focus ===\"; sed -n '/ANCHOR:next-focus/,/\\/ANCHOR:next-focus/p' \"$L/deep-research-strategy.md\""},"output":"{\"iteration\":1,\"status\":\"complete\",\"newInfoRatio\":1,\"findingsCount\":null}\n=== questions ===\n<!-- ANCHOR:key-questions -->\n## 3. KEY QUESTIONS (remaining)\n- [x] What does one in-process handler call cost from a cold node process, and does its worst case fit the hook's 2.5 s budget?\n- [x] What does a warm handler call cost in a process that already loaded the modules, and how much of the cold cost is module load rather than scoring?\n- [x] How does the in-process handler compare with today's Python fallback scorer on the same prompts?\n- [ ] Would the in-process answer change the degraded top, the typed command and the mode label under the Q026 filter, and do the floors hold?\n- [ ] How much of the hook's 2.5 s budget is left when the degraded CLI path uses the in-process handler instead of the Python spawn?\n\n<!-- /ANCHOR:key-questions -->\n=== answered ===\n<!-- ANCHOR:answered-questions -->\n## 6. ANSWERED QUESTIONS\n- What does one in-process handler call cost from a cold node process, and does its worst case fit the hook's 2.5 s budget?\n- What does a warm handler call cost in a process that already loaded the modules, and how much of the cold cost is module load rather than scoring?\n- How does the in-process handler compare with today's Python fallback scorer on the same prompts?\n\n<!-- /ANCHOR:answered-questions -->\n=== next focus ===\n<!-- ANCHOR:next-focus -->\n## 11. NEXT FOCUS\nFollow up on: The floors are unchanged at the built HEAD: typed recall 24 of 44, false offers 0 of 35, plain tune 23 of 45 and attached false offers 0 of 35. The capture took 8.96 s. [SOURCE: specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-...\n\n<!-- /ANCHOR:next-focus -->\n","title":"shell","metadata":{"metadata":{"status":"completed","truncated":false,"exit":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"iteration\":1,\"status\":\"complete\",\"newInfoRatio\":1,\"findingsCount\":null}\n=== questions ===\n<!-- ANCHOR:key-questions -->\n## 3. KEY QUESTIONS (remaining)\n- [x] What does one in-process handler call cost from a cold node process, and does its worst case fit the hook's 2.5 s budget?\n- [x] What does a warm handler call cost in a process that already loaded the modules, and how much of the cold cost is module load rather than scoring?\n- [x] How does the in-process handler compare with today's Python fallback scorer on the same prompts?\n- [ ] Would the in-process answer change the degraded top, the typed command and the mode label under the Q026 filter, and do the floors hold?\n- [ ] How much of the hook's 2.5 s budget is left when the degraded CLI path uses the in-process handler instead of the Python spawn?\n\n<!-- /ANCHOR:key-questions -->\n=== answered ===\n<!-- ANCHOR:answered-questions -->\n## 6. ANSWERED QUESTIONS\n- What does one in-process handler call cost from a cold node process, and does its worst case fit the hook's 2.5 s budget?\n- What does a warm handler call cost in a process that already loaded the modules, and how much of the cold cost is module load rather than scoring?\n- How does the in-process handler compare with today's Python fallback scorer on the same prompts?\n\n<!-- /ANCHOR:answered-questions -->\n=== next focus ===\n<!-- ANCHOR:next-focus -->\n## 11. NEXT FOCUS\nFollow up on: The floors are unchanged at the built HEAD: typed recall 24 of 44, false offers 0 of 35, plain tune 23 of 45 and attached false offers 0 of 35. The capture took 8.96 s. [SOURCE: specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-...\n\n<!-- /ANCHOR:next-focus -->\n"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"command\":\"L=specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/lineages/inprocess-timing-4\\njq -c 'select(.type==\\\"iteration\\\") | {iteration,status,newInfoRatio,findingsCount}' \\\"$L/deep-research-state.jsonl\\\"; echo \\\"=== questions ===\\\"; sed -n '/ANCHOR:key-questions/,/\\\\/ANCHOR:key-questions/p' \\\"$L/deep-research-strategy.md\\\"; echo \\\"=== answered ===\\\"; sed -n '/ANCHOR:answered-questions/,/\\\\/ANCHOR:answered-questions/p' \\\"$L/deep-research-strategy.md\\\"; echo \\\"=== next focus ===\\\"; sed -n '/ANCHOR:next-focus/,/\\\\/ANCHOR:next-focus/p' \\\"$L/deep-research-strategy.md\\\"\"}"},"time":{"start":1794570709743,"end":1794570711211}}}}
